
# we must convert pixels to our units for ComplexNumber because if we dont the maths would break
- on a mathmatical plane: moving 1 unit forward means adding a vector of magnitude 1
- on a pixel plane: if 1 unit = 1 pixel, your tanks speed is restricted to 1 pixel per frame and if you try to increase it,
  it would be like adding more to the vector when rotating which would fold and bend the rectangle and break the game

- on my monitor it may look good
- on an invidulators bigger/smaller, the tank may move much faster or slower, and the tank may spawn offscreen

- by using a scale factor, the logic would stay the same in all situations, keeping gameplay constant

